// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Ambassador Kuhr'Rekt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1395642795" "Ambassador Kuhr'Rekt"
// ProfessionString :
"P4072535872" "Rikti Restructurist Ambassador"
// DescriptionString :
"P1117892557" "Ambassador Kuhr'Rekt is a high-ranking member of the Rikti Restructurists, one of the two factions among the alien invaders that have appeared since their initial attack was stalled. Now that the rival Traditionalist faction has started to increase their smaller numbers while advocating long-term accommodation with the heroes of humanity, the Restructurists have decided that it is imperative they are stopped, even if doing so means working with elements of humanity. To this end, Kuhr'Rekt is on Grandville at the request of Lord Recluse himself, representing his people to trade assets, information, and technology that can be used against their mutual enemies."
// BadgeNeededString :
"P129733938" "Acknowledgement: Presence of {VillainName}. Introduction self: Ambassador Kuhr'Rect, Rikti Restructurist Faction. Purpose of presence: Arachnos negotiations. Further interaction {VillainName}: Not Possible. {VillainName} accomplishments: Insufficient. Sufficient accomplishment judged: 25 badges. Acquire 25 badges: {VillainName} status upgraded: worth talking to."
// BadgeFirstTick :
"P285744408" "Acknowledgement: {VillainName}. Status of {VillainName}: Insufficient for continued conversation. {VillainName} requires: 25 badges. {VillainName} possesses: 8 or fewer badges."
// BadgeSecondTick :
"P582035669" "Greeting: {VillainName}. Status of {VillainName}: Approaching relevance. {VillainName} requires: 25 badges. {VillainName} possesses: 13 or fewer badges."
// BadgeThirdTick :
"P2347975845" "Welcome: {VillainName}. Status of {VillainName}: Nearly relevant. {VillainName} requires: 25 badges. {VillainName} possesses: 19 or fewer badges."
// BadgeFourthTick :
"P1611072687" "Obsequious deference: {VillainName}. Possession of 25 or more badges: Respect commanded."
// HelloString :
"P2985334410" "Arrival noted: Duly."
// HelloString :
"P3389748066" "Cordial acknowledgement: {VillainName}."
// HelloString :
"P1129755700" "Salutations: {VillainName}."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3409362752" "Your identity: unknown: Unworthy of note. Interaction requires precursor: {VillainName} badge count: 25."
// FirstVisitString :
"P196538069" "Begin: Proper introduction. Individual name: Ambassador Kuhr'Rekt. Status: Rikti Restructurist Ambassador. Purpose of Mission: Ararchnos Negotiations. Secondary Purpose: Sabotage Rikti Traditionalist faction. Require deniable aid: Completion of both agendas. {VillainName} reputation: Well known. Probablity of success: Very likely."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1658123001" "All tasks: Complete. Further work: nonexistant. Working with you: A pleasure. To you: Good day."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2765396278" "Your work status: Overburdened. Current tasks: require completion. Current tasks complete: Return."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P228037974" "{VillainName} power: Insufficient. {VillainName} return: Threat level 40."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2497557543" "Status of relation: upgraded. Invitation extended: <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Consume mass quantities.</A>"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2349477764" "Relation status: Maximum. Will provide: Communication codes. Extend offer: <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Material goods</A>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2860685578" "Your power: too great. Opportunity: Missed."
// LocationString :
"P3340683840" "Grandville"
// IntroString :
"P388006588" "This Text: Never Seen"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


