// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Dr_Forrester 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Dr. Forrester 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1710823606" "Dr. Forrester"
// ProfessionString :
"P4003410802" "Mad Scientist"
// DescriptionString :
"P3699772648" "Dr. Forrester is a brilliant if unbalanced scientist who has come to Grandville to develop new technologies in the service of Lord Recluse. He has taken a special interest in mutation theory and the Arachnoids who lurk in the Gutter of Grandville."
// HelloString :
"P503174593" "Ready to delve into secrets man was not meant to know? Good, I thought so!"
// HelloString :
"P3804644868" "Hello, {VillainName}. Let's get down to work, shall we?"
// HelloString :
"P2366134910" "Ah, there you are, {VillainName}!"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1036269101" "Don't bother me right now! I'm very busy with my experiments!"
// FirstVisitString :
"P2774681755" "Hello there, {VillainName}! I'm Dr. Forrester, one of Dr. Aeon's lead scientists from AeonCorp in Cap Au Diable. I've come to Grandville to develop technologies in the service of Lord Recluse, especially in the area of applied mutation science. My other lab assistant, Dr. Geist, is otherwise busy with matters on Mercy Island, so I have need of freelancers to help me... investigate a few matters of interest. If things work out well, who knows what wonderments and atrocities we could unleash upon an unsuspecting world? Does that pique your curiousity? Good, I hoped it would!"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2808780198" "While your work as a lab assistant has been satisfactory, you've probably seen far too much as is, and I need you to maintain a plausible deniability. Thanks for you assistance, and don't forget to punch out."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P159988002" "I need to have complete and undivided attention from my lab assistants! Clear some work off your plate before speaking with me again, {VillainName}!"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2647138767" "Sometimes lab work is dangerous business. Come back when you're Threat Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P123779906" "This may work out, {VillainName}. Check out these <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</a>"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1110563490" "You've proven yourself an excellent lab assistant! Feel free to scavenge these <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</a> from the lab!"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3021967153" "You've grown in infamy, {VillainName}! Perhaps a bit too much. I need to keep my research more low key, so I must dismiss you as an AeonCorp employee. Thanks and remember to punch out before you leave."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P4085534521" "I know a strange man, an employee of AeonCorp, named Dr. Forrester. He's in Grandville doing some science in Grandville for Arachnos and is looking for a lab assistant."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P36479011" "Choose Dr. Forrester"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P946336714" "Dr. Forrester is kind of crazy, but then again, I guess that's why they call them mad scientists."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


