// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Mage_Killer_Zuhkara 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Mage-Killer Zuhkara 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3675000522" "Mage-Killer Zuhkara"
// ProfessionString :
"P3391522098" "Arcane Assassin"
// DescriptionString :
"P3067706661" "Zukhara comes from a long line of arcane assassins trained in Russia. A unique series of technomagical augmentations rendered her nearly immune to magic. Combined with her intense training, these enhancements rendered her ready to wreak havoc on American magical spies. Unfortunately, her training ended at about the same time as the Cold War, so she was never deployed. She spurned the CIA and Malta Group's offers, and decided to go freelance. Recluse caught up to her as she was jumping between factions in the Middle East. She doesn't have a strong loyalty to Arachnos or Recluse, but she does get to kill mages, which is what she likes best."
// HelloString :
"P149889740" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>There are dark things that need doing.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P630511403" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I have work for you.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P3909433192" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>There are people I mean to harm.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2030425989" "I am a dangerous woman, {VillainName}. You would do well not to bother me until you have more experience under your belt. Speak with the one they call Korol. She will send you to me, or dispose of you, as she likes."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3716261102" "So, {VillainName}, here we are. I believe that each of us stands on the precipice of the world we would create. For myself, that would be a world without magic, a world without the treachery and perversion of the mages I hunt. As for you, I cannot say. But I can promise you this: work with me, do not question my authority, and I will help you get one step closer to creating that world."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2891900871" "We have nothing more to say to one another."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P137271720" "You are too eager, {VillainName}. Finish some of your current jobs before seeking more."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1575710598" "I'll speak with you again, but not until you're Threat Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P686587024" "I am beginning to trust you, something that does not come easily to me. I will allow you greater access to my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>store.</a> You may contact me at any time."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3863839669" "{VillainName}, I feel we could almost be friends. Please, avail yourself of <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>all</a> that I have."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1455035032" "You have too bright a future to be hanging around here, {VillainName}."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1465157962" "I know a woman named Mage-Killer Zuhkara. She's an assassin from Russia who specializes in eliminating spies with magical backgrounds. She's looking for someone to help her with a few hits."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P4110892086" "Choose Mage-Killer Zuhkara"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3422569917" "Zuhkara is very blunt and to the point, and she seems to take a personal interest in destroying those of arcane origin."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2545772478" "There is <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</a> I'd like to introduce you to."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


